      "message_parsed": "Тема ясна))<br />\nОбновляем ревизию, заходим Шаблоны для релизов =&gt; Добавить шаблон! во всех строчка пишем images<br />\n<b>открыть</b> lang_admin_bt.php<br />\nнайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$lang[&#039;TPL_SPORT&#039;] = &#039;Спорт&#039;;</pre>ниже вставить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$lang[&#039;TPL_IMAGES&#039;] = &#039;Изображение&#039;;</pre><br />\nоткрыть lang_topic_templates<br />\nв самый конец<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">// Images tpl\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;TIMATICS&#039;] = &#039;Тематика&#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;COUNT&#039;] = &#039;Количество&#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;SB&#039;] = &#039;Разрешение от&#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;SE&#039;] = &#039;до&#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;PCS&#039;] = &#039;.шт&#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;X&#039;] = &#039; - &#039;;\n$lang[&#039;TPL&#039;][&#039;IMAGES_FORMATS&#039;] = &#039;Формат&#039;;</pre>tpl_selects.php<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\"> &#039;SEL_IMAGES_FORMATS&#039; =&gt; array(\n &#039;BMP&#039;,\n &#039;JPG, JPEG&#039;,\n &#039;GIF&#039;,\n &#039;PNG&#039;,\n ),</pre>ну вроде все)<br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/90/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/0/90-e1502779dd99be8a3000c9badf3f6127.jpg?hash=tnHxvuW-CM\" alt=\"1.webp\" /></a><a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/91/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/0/91-82424762af69c066b40bc9a60ea69783.jpg?hash=lVdA897h95\" alt=\"2.webp\" /></a>",
